msgstr "デモを見てみる"

msgid "We tailor it. You decide how to wear it."
msgstr "仕立ては私たちが。着こなしは、あなたが。"

msgid "Web design"
msgstr "ウェブデザイン"

msgid "What keeps a site healthy after launch, in your hands or in theirs."
msgstr "公開後もサイトを健全に保つための取り組みです。"

